   {
    "name": "The Observatory Newsroom Watch",
    "insight": "Corporate reputation moments close quickly, and the platform needs cleared proof ready before Vivacom enters them.",
    "idea": "Use The Observatory newsroom to watch for moments where So You Can and The Invisible Thread can enter with approved household, reach or service proof.",
    "engagement_mechanic": "The newsroom logs relevant market, service, media and stakeholder moments, then recommends whether to enter, hold or escalate.",
    "desired_outcome": "Vivacom joins the right moments with proof-led lines instead of reactive broad claims.",
    "targets": "The Observatory register is read weekly from Month 1 through Month 12, and every recommended entry is checked against the claim boundary before use.",
