   {
    "name": "The Invisible Thread at Home",
    "insight": "Existing customers judge Vivacom first through ordinary home moments: internet, television, bills, app payments, outages and help.",
    "idea": "Launch So You Can through The Invisible Thread with one named household story that shows Vivacom helping daily life continue without asking people to admire the system behind it.",
    "engagement_mechanic": "Lead with earned media, then send readers to owned proof explaining the services and support behind the moment, with shared and selective paid support.",
    "desired_outcome": "Maya and existing customers see Vivacom as useful and warmer because the platform is shown through daily household proof.",
    "targets": "Earned coverage, owned proof-page analytics and launch message recall are read weekly in Months 3 and 4, with a Launch close read at the end of Month 4.",
    "hashtag_or_signature": "So You Can / The Invisible Thread starts at home",
    "audience": "Existing customers, with Maya as the first believer, plus media and consumer audiences.",
    "message_pillar": "Vivacom keeps The Invisible Thread working, So You Can get on with daily life.",
    "peso_channel": "Earned, owned, shared and selective paid.",
    "phase": "Launch",
