  "hero_hub_hygiene_balance": {
   "hero": "The signature moments are The Invisible Thread at Home in Month 3 and Beyond the Home Cleared Cases in Month 10, keeping the biggest effort to roughly a fifth of the year and always naming So You Can.",
   "hub": "The sustained programmes are The Observatory, advocacy briefing, launch reinforcement, Household Proof Series, expert proof and third-party amplification, carrying about three fifths of the effort through recurring proof.",
   "hygiene": "The maintenance layer is proof lock, Conversation Management, Reach Clearly Explained, Service Moment Response Lines and the year-close scorecard, keeping the platform disciplined between campaign peaks."
